1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,200
And five kinds of process.

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,856
Isothermal, constant temperature.

3
00:00:04,856 --> 00:00:07,239
Isobaric, constant pressure.

4
00:00:07,239 --> 00:00:11,432
Isochoric, constant volume, so no expansion work.

5
00:00:11,432 --> 00:00:14,270
Adiabatic, no heat exchanged.

6
00:00:14,270 --> 00:00:20,091
And cyclic, returning to the start, so every state function change is zero.

